@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

<header class="about-hero">
    <p class="about-eyebrow">About me</p>
    <h1>A junior .NET developer focused on building reliable web applications</h1>
    <p class="about-introduction">
        I’m Nazmul Hussain, a Northcoders graduate developing full-stack
        applications with C#, ASP.NET Core and Blazor.
    </p>
</header>

<section class="about-journey" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
    <div class="about-section-heading">
        <p class="about-section-label">My journey</p>
        <h2 id="journey-title">Developing through hands-on experience</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="journey-content">
        <p>
            I developed my software engineering foundations through the Northcoders
            Enterprise Engineering Bootcamp, combining technical learning with regular
            hands-on development.
        </p>

        <p>
            I applied those skills by building RecordShop independently and contributing
            to Calico through pair programming, daily stand-ups, Trello planning and
            collaborative Git reviews.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-learning" aria-labelledby="learning-title">
    <div class="about-section-heading">
        <p class="about-section-label">Northcoders</p>
        <h2 id="learning-title">Skills developed through practical projects</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="learning-grid">
        <article class="learning-card">
            <h3>Backend development</h3>
            <p>
                Designing layered ASP.NET Core APIs and working with application logic,
                Entity Framework Core and relational databases.
            </p>
        </article>

        <article class="learning-card">
            <h3>Testing and quality</h3>
            <p>
                Writing automated tests with NUnit, Moq and Shouldly to verify behaviour
                and improve the reliability and maintainability of code.
            </p>
        </article>

        <article class="learning-card">
            <h3>Team collaboration</h3>
            <p>
                Pair programming, guiding teammates and coordinating work through daily
                stand-ups, Trello planning and collaborative Git reviews.
            </p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div class="about-section-heading">
        <p class="about-section-label">My approach</p>
        <h2 id="approach-title">How I approach development</h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="approach-list">
        <li>
            <span class="approach-number">01</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Understand the problem</h3>
                <p>
                    Clarify the requirements, break features into manageable tasks and plan
                    the work before beginning implementation.
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>

        <li>
            <span class="approach-number">02</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Build with care</h3>
                <p>
                    Separate responsibilities into clear layers, write readable code and test
                    important behaviour to make applications easier to maintain.
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>

        <li>
            <span class="approach-number">03</span>
            <div>
                <h3>Learn from feedback</h3>
                <p>
                    Use pair programming, code reviews, testing and team feedback to improve
                    both the solution and my development skills.
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section class="about-cta" aria-labelledby="about-cta-title">
    <p class="about-section-label">Next steps</p>
    <h2 id="about-cta-title">See what I’ve been building</h2>

    <p class="about-cta-summary">
        Explore my projects to see these skills in practice, or get in touch to
        discuss a junior C#/.NET development opportunity.
    </p>

    <div class="about-actions">
        <NavLink class="about-link about-link-primary" href="/projects">
            View my projects
        </NavLink>
        <NavLink class="about-link about-link-secondary" href="/contact">
            Contact me
        </NavLink>
    </div>
</section>
